      "expected": "Each 120R termination resistor should connect between the CANH and CANL of its own bus (e.g., R34 between /CAN0_P and /CAN0_N, R35 between /CAN1_P and /CAN1_N), with the DIP switch enabling/disabling each termination independently.",
